<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Elbatelier — Pixel Studio</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Ein lokales Pixelatelier für Hamburg. Echte Raster, einzelne Ebenen und verlustfreier PNG-Export." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header><a class="wordmark" href="/pixel-studio">elbatelier<span>PIXEL STUDIO / 01</span></a><div class="header-actions"><button id="open">Projekt öffnen</button><button id="save">Projekt speichern</button><button class="primary" id="export">PNG exportieren ↗</button></div></header>
    <main>
      <section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">EINE STADT. MILLIONEN MÖGLICHKEITEN.</p><h1>Hamburg, Pixel für Pixel.</h1><p class="lede">Abendlicht auf der Elbe. Und jeder Punkt in deiner Hand.</p></div><div class="edition">53°32′ N &nbsp; 9°59′ O<br /><span>Studie № 001 · Goldene Stunde</span></div></section>
      <section class="studio" aria-label="Pixel-Editor">
        <div class="toolbar"><div class="tools" role="group" aria-label="Zeichenwerkzeug"><button data-tool="pencil" aria-pressed="true" title="Stift (B)">✎ <span>Stift</span></button><button data-tool="eraser" aria-pressed="false" title="Radierer (E)">⌫ <span>Radierer</span></button><button data-tool="picker" aria-pressed="false" title="Pipette (I)">⌖ <span>Pipette</span></button><label class="brush">Spitze <select id="brush"><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>4</option><option>8</option><option>16</option></select> px</label></div><div class="view-tools"><button id="undo" disabled title="Rückgängig (⌘Z)">↶</button><button id="redo" disabled title="Wiederholen (⌘⇧Z)">↷</button><span class="divider"></span><button id="grid" aria-pressed="false">Raster</button><label>Zoom <select id="zoom"><option value="fit">Einpassen</option><option value="1">100 %</option><option value="2">200 %</option><option value="4">400 %</option><option value="8">800 %</option><option value="16">1600 %</option></select></label></div></div>
        <div class="workspace" id="workspace"><div id="canvas-wrap"><canvas id="art" width="1280" height="384" aria-label="Hamburg-Panorama. Zum Zeichnen Stift oder Radierer wählen und auf dem Bild ziehen."></canvas><div id="grid-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div>
        <div class="statusbar"><span id="dimensions">1280 × 384 px</span><span id="coordinates">Feste Palette · keine Kantenglättung</span><span id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Bereit</span></div>
        <div class="inspector"><section class="palette-section"><h2>Die Farben des Abends <span id="color-label">#F2C49B</span></h2><div id="palette" aria-label="Farbpalette"></div><p>Stift B · Radierer E · Pipette I · Rückgängig ⌘/Strg Z</p></section><section class="layers-section"><h2>Ebenen <span>VON VORN NACH HINTEN</span></h2><div id="layers"></div></section></div>
      </section>
      <section class="below"><div><p class="eyebrow">DAS RASTER IST DAS ORIGINAL</p><h2>Mehr Raum für Details.</h2><p>Die Auflösung bestimmt die Anzahl der bearbeitbaren Pixel. Zoom vergrößert nur deine Ansicht. Der PNG-Export behält jeden Pixel exakt bei.</p></div><form id="size-form"><label>Breite <input id="width" type="number" min="64" max="4096" value="1280" required /> px</label><span>×</span><label>Höhe <input id="height" type="number" min="32" max="2048" value="384" required /> px</label><button type="submit">Neue Hamburg-Studie ↗</button><p>Bis 4096 × 2048 px. Die Szene wird neu gezeichnet; speichere vorher deine Änderungen.</p></form></section>
      <details><summary>Mit Code weiterzeichnen <span>Für unsere Zusammenarbeit</span></summary><p>Projekt als JSON speichern und hier wieder öffnen. Die Datei enthält Palette, Ebenen und echte Pixelwerte. Die Zeichenfunktionen für Pixel, Linien, Rechtecke und Polygone liegen in <code>public/pixel-studio/engine.js</code>. Damit kann ich Motive gezielt ergänzen und die gesamte Szene reproduzierbar aufbauen.</p></details>
      <footer><span>ELBATELIER — DIGITAL HANDWERK</span><span>Lokal im Browser · Speichere dein Projekt vor dem Schließen</span></footer>
    </main>
    <input type="file" id="file" accept=".json,application/json" hidden />
    <script src="/pixel-studio/studio.js" is:inline type="module"></script>
  </body>
</html>
<style is:global>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f5f3ed;color:#343c38;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px}button,input,select{font:inherit;color:inherit}button,select{cursor:pointer}button{background:transparent;border:1px solid #d9dcd2;border-radius:4px;padding:10px 14px;transition:background .15s}button:hover{background:#e8e9df}button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #48634c;outline-offset:3px}.primary{background:#344f40;color:#f5f3ed;border-color:#344f40}.primary:hover{background:#253f30}header{padding:23px 4vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #dcded4;gap:20px}.wordmark{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:31px;letter-spacing:-1.5px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px}.wordmark span,.eyebrow,.edition,footer{font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.8px}.wordmark span{letter-spacing:2px;padding-left:25px;border-left:1px solid #c7cbbf}.header-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}main{max-width:1800px;margin:auto;padding:0 4vw}.intro{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;padding:43px 0 32px;gap:20px}.eyebrow{font-weight:600;color:#657060;margin:0 0 14px}h1{font:normal clamp(32px,3.2vw,52px)/1.1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-1.7px;margin:0 0 13px}.lede{color:#747b70;margin:0;font-size:14px}.edition{text-align:right;line-height:2;letter-spacing:1px}.edition span{letter-spacing:.3px;color:#7b8277}.studio{border:1px solid #d4d7cc;background:#faf9f4;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;gap:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #d4d7cc}.tools,.view-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.toolbar button{padding:8px 10px;border-color:transparent}.toolbar button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#e0e6d9;border-color:#c4cdbb}.toolbar select{padding:7px 5px;border:1px solid #d9dcd2;border-radius:3px;background:transparent}.toolbar label{font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.brush{margin-left:10px}.divider{height:23px;border-left:1px solid #d4d7cc;margin:0 6px}.workspace{min-height:330px;height:clamp(330px,36vw,600px);background:#e7e7dc;overflow:auto;display:grid;align-items:center;justify-items:center;padding:36px;position:relative}.workspace.zoomed{display:block}#canvas-wrap{position:relative;flex-shrink:0;line-height:0;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #35433018}canvas{image-rendering:pixelated;display:block}#art{touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair}#grid-canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none}.statusbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;border-block:1px solid #d4d7cc;padding:10px 16px;color:#72796e;font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.statusbar span:first-child{color:#394e3b}.inspector{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:35px;padding:24px}h2{font:normal 21px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 16px}h2 span{font:10px 'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#7b8277;letter-spacing:1px;margin-left:14px}#palette{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;max-width:540px}#palette button{height:27px;width:27px;border:2px solid transparent;padding:0;border-radius:2px}#palette button[aria-pressed=true]{outline:2px solid #344f40;outline-offset:2px}.palette-section p{font-size:11px;color:#777f72;line-height:1.8;margin-top:18px}#layers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px 15px}.layer-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}.layer-row button{padding:5px 7px;border:0;font-size:11px;text-align:left}.layer-row .layer-name{flex:1}.layer-row .layer-name[aria-pressed=true]{background:#e4e9de}.visibility{min-width:30px}.below{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;padding:34px 0 26px}.below h2{font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin-bottom:10px}.below p{color:#737b6f;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;max-width:540px}.below .eyebrow{font-size:9px}form{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-content:center;align-items:end;gap:12px}form label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:11px}form input{padding:8px;width:105px;border:1px solid #cbd1c3;background:#faf9f4;border-radius:3px}form p{flex-basis:100%;margin:0}form>span{align-self:center}form button{margin-bottom:20px}details{border-block:1px solid #d4d7cc;padding:18px 0;font-size:12px}summary{cursor:pointer}summary span{color:#7b8277;margin-left:16px}details p{max-width:850px;line-height:1.8;color:#687261}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:23px 0 30px;gap:20px;color:#7c8376;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px}footer span:last-child{letter-spacing:.3px} @media(max-width:850px){.wordmark span,.edition{display:none}.toolbar{flex-wrap:wrap}.inspector,.below{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.workspace{padding:16px;min-height:240px;height:320px}.intro{padding-top:30px}.header-actions button{font-size:11px;padding:8px}header{flex-wrap:wrap}#coordinates{display:none}.below{padding:28px 0}.brush{margin-left:0}.toolbar{padding:9px}.tools{flex-wrap:wrap}.toolbar button{padding:8px}footer{flex-wrap:wrap}#layers{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important}}
</style>
